{"id":"2fbf7ac563ea4261","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-pr-definitional-extension.md","title":"Elimination of Primitive-Recursive Function Abbreviations","display":"df-pr-definitional-extension — Elimination of Primitive-Recursive Function Abbreviations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-pr-definitional-extension","aliases":["67-df-pr-definitional-extension"],"display":"df-pr-definitional-extension — Elimination of Primitive-Recursive Function Abbreviations","depends_on":["[[67-df-pr-graph-interface]]","[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-syntax-interface]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-pr-definitional-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-pr-definitional-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pr-definitional-extension — Elimination of Primitive-Recursive Function Abbreviations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f115352299e944bf\" href=\"?note=f115352299e944bf\" title=\"67-df-pr-graph-interface\">67-df-pr-graph-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\">\\(e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\)</span> 增加一个新的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span>，与算术符号及彼此区分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A^D\">\\(L_A^D\\)</span> 是下式给出的扩展签名。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t(y)\">\\(V_t(y)\\)</span> 为扩展项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的算术值图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_D\">\\(E_D\\)</span> 为扩展公式到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 公式的消去函数。辅助变量由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}\\)</span> 选取；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}\\)</span> 的有限树递归同样用于扩展项。各分支所排除的变量集在下式指定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\{0,S,+,\\times\\}\">\\(h\\in\\{0,S,+,\\times\\}\\)</span>，元数按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 为扩展项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 为扩展公式。零元分支的存在变量表和合取均为空。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(W\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\vdash_D\\varphi\">\\(W\\vdash_D\\varphi\\)</span> 的右侧是原本的一阶可推导性。使用定义扩展计算公式时最终取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_D\">\\(E_D\\)</span>，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 暗中当成原算术语言中的项。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>除恒等分支外，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_D\">\\(E_D\\)</span> 的递归式仅用于含有新增函数符号的输入；逻辑子式不含新增符号时立即使用恒等分支。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\\oplus_F\">\\(L_A\\oplus_F\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nH_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F_e:e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\},&amp;\na_D(F_e)&amp;\\coloneqq k\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k),\\\\\nL_A^D&amp;\\coloneqq L_A\\oplus_F(H_D,a_D),\\\\\nV_x(y)&amp;\\coloneqq(y=x),\\\\\nV_{h(\\vec t)}(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists\\vec z\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}V_{t_i}(z_i)\\land y=h(\\vec z)\\right)\n\\quad\\left(\\vec z=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(h(\\vec t))\\cup\\{y\\},|\\vec t|)\\right),\\\\\nV_{F_e(\\vec t)}(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists\\vec z\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}V_{t_i}(z_i)\\land D_e(\\vec z,y)\\right)\n\\quad\\left(\\vec z=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(F_e(\\vec t))\\cup\\{y\\},|\\vec t|)\\right),\\\\\nE_D(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists y\\exists z\\left(V_t(y)\\land V_u(z)\\land y=z\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left((t=u)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\land\n\\langle y,z\\rangle=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(u),2)\\right),\\\\\nE_D(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg E_D(\\varphi)\n\\quad(\\neg\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq E_D(\\varphi)\\land E_D(\\psi)\n\\quad((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,E_D(\\varphi)\n\\quad(\\forall x\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\n(W\\vdash_D\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow W\\vdash E_D(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}^D&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\n\\{\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\,(F_e(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow D_e(\\vec x,y)):\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land\n\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle\\land y=v_k\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nH_D&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F_e:e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\},&amp;\na_D(F_e)&amp;\\coloneqq k\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k),\\\\\nL_A^D&amp;\\coloneqq L_A\\oplus_F(H_D,a_D),\\\\\nV_x(y)&amp;\\coloneqq(y=x),\\\\\nV_{h(\\vec t)}(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists\\vec z\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}V_{t_i}(z_i)\\land y=h(\\vec z)\\right)\n\\quad\\left(\\vec z=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(h(\\vec t))\\cup\\{y\\},|\\vec t|)\\right),\\\\\nV_{F_e(\\vec t)}(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists\\vec z\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}V_{t_i}(z_i)\\land D_e(\\vec z,y)\\right)\n\\quad\\left(\\vec z=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(F_e(\\vec t))\\cup\\{y\\},|\\vec t|)\\right),\\\\\nE_D(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists y\\exists z\\left(V_t(y)\\land V_u(z)\\land y=z\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left((t=u)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\land\n\\langle y,z\\rangle=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(u),2)\\right),\\\\\nE_D(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg E_D(\\varphi)\n\\quad(\\neg\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq E_D(\\varphi)\\land E_D(\\psi)\n\\quad((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,E_D(\\varphi)\n\\quad(\\forall x\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\n(W\\vdash_D\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow W\\vdash E_D(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}^D&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\n\\{\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\,(F_e(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow D_e(\\vec x,y)):\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land\n\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle\\land y=v_k\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有新增函数名均通过给定程序和图公式确定；E_D 给出实际消去步骤。PA 上图公式的唯一存在性使这种记法是定义扩展，而非增加未解释函数或额外数学公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-pr-graph-interface","status":"resolved","id":"f115352299e944bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-pr-graph-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V_t(y)$ 为扩展项 $t$ 的算术值图；$E_D$ 为扩展公式到 $L_A$ 公式的消去函数。辅助变量由 [[67-df-formula]] 的 $\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}$ 选取；$\\operatorname{var}$ 的有限树递归同样用于扩展项。各分支所排除的变量集在下式指定。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"除恒等分支外，$E_D$ 的递归式仅用于含有新增函数符号的输入；逻辑子式不含新增符号时立即使用恒等分支。$L_A\\oplus_F$ 取 [[67-df-syntax-interface]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"L_A^D","display":false},{"tex":"V_t(y)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"E_D","display":false},{"tex":"L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\{0,S,+,\\times\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L_A","display":false},{"tex":"t,u","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"W\\vdash_D\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"E_D","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"E_D","display":false},{"tex":"L_A\\oplus_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nH_D&\\coloneqq\\{F_e:e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\},&\na_D(F_e)&\\coloneqq k\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k),\\\\\nL_A^D&\\coloneqq L_A\\oplus_F(H_D,a_D),\\\\\nV_x(y)&\\coloneqq(y=x),\\\\\nV_{h(\\vec t)}(y)&\\coloneqq\\exists\\vec z\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{i<|\\vec t|}V_{t_i}(z_i)\\land y=h(\\vec z)\\right)\n\\quad\\left(\\vec z=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(h(\\vec t))\\cup\\{y\\},|\\vec t|)\\right),\\\\\nV_{F_e(\\vec t)}(y)&\\coloneqq\\exists\\vec z\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{i<|\\vec t|}V_{t_i}(z_i)\\land D_e(\\vec z,y)\\right)\n\\quad\\left(\\vec z=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(F_e(\\vec t))\\cup\\{y\\},|\\vec t|)\\right),\\\\\nE_D(\\alpha)&\\coloneqq\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(t=u)&\\coloneqq\\exists y\\exists z\\left(V_t(y)\\land V_u(z)\\land y=z\\right)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\left((t=u)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\land\n\\langle y,z\\rangle=\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_{L_A}(\\operatorname{var}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(u),2)\\right),\\\\\nE_D(\\neg\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\neg E_D(\\varphi)\n\\quad(\\neg\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&\\coloneqq E_D(\\varphi)\\land E_D(\\psi)\n\\quad((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\nE_D(\\forall x\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,E_D(\\varphi)\n\\quad(\\forall x\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A^D}\\setminus\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}),\\\\\n(W\\vdash_D\\varphi)&\\Longleftrightarrow W\\vdash E_D(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}^D&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\n\\{\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\,(F_e(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow D_e(\\vec x,y)):\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land\n\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle\\land y=v_k\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3792,"backlinks":[{"id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对本条每个数值函数 $f$，固定程序 $e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{\\operatorname{arity}(f)}$，满足 $⟦ e_f⟧=f$。在算术公式中写 $f$ 时使用 $F_{e_f}$，并按 [[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]] 取 $E_D$；不将外部函数直接插入原语言。"},{"id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"下式 $\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_D$ 取 [[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]，因此其中的代码函数、有限列编码和项求值记号都有确定消去式。$\\varepsilon,\\delta,n,m$ 是元层参数；每个可证式中的数值变量显式绑定。"},{"id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E_D$ 取 [[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]。$\\operatorname{Len}$、$(p)_i$ 分别是各自程序的 $F_e$ 缩写；$\\sigma$ 作为原语言子公式嵌入扩展语言后一起消去。所有最终的 $\\mathrm{Prf}_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Prov}_\\sigma,\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 都属于原算术语言。"},{"id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定下式每个数值函数 $f\\in\\{\\mathrm{fm}_L,\\mathrm{sn}_L,\\mathrm{la}_L,\\mathrm{imp}_L,\\mathrm{all}_L\\}$ 的程序 $e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{\\operatorname{arity}(f)}$，$⟦ e_f⟧=f$。对象公式中的 $f$ 记 $F_{e_f}$；$\\operatorname{Len}$、序列投影使用 [[67-df-formula-provability]] 的同一指定程序，并由 [[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]] 的 $E_D$ 消去。"},{"id":"045076ed5daf4d97","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ell:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 在下式定义；固定 $e_\\ell\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_2$ 满足 $⟦ e_\\ell⟧=\\ell$。扩展函数符号 $F_{e_\\ell}$ 及消去 $E_D$ 取 [[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]；对象公式中的 $\\operatorname{sn}$ 使用其同一指定程序。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-pr-definitional-extension]] — Elimination of Primitive-Recursive Function Abbreviations。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["f115352299e944bf","2035a1f4d72e7df9","3f06c9fe86c236dd"]}